      "Physical P marks and logical Q occurrences are distinct, including all-zero-Q library fixtures.",
      "Escaped prefixes, inherited Array .sizeN coordinate and inherited descriptor depth are distinct and retained.",
      "Persisted structures are discovered parent-first; exact site/plan/physical/limit identities are retained rather than rebound.",
      "Codec and transport budgets are shared within the operation; write-direction/wider-limit read budgets reject before charges/source reads.",
      "LowCardinality sites replay state before later/end-zero selections; supplied actual descriptors are bounded even when unused.",
      "Invalid preparation/encoding precedes publication; no per-product leaf serializers."
    ],
    "architecture": "One class/file for the Dynamic site owner and one-shot descriptor preflight receipt; standalone facade delegates. Not repository-wide decomposition.",
